# VIVA Chat Chrome

Every VIVA conversation uses the same chrome. Do not invent a local bubble, avatar row, or thinking style.

## Required components

From `src/components/viva/VivaChatMessage.tsx` and `VivaChatInput.tsx`:

- Member text → `VivaUserMessage` (VIVA purple / `accent-500`)
- VIVA text → `VivaAssistantMessage` + `VivaMarkdown` (no bubble)
- Waiting → `VivaThinkingIndicator`
- Composer → `VivaChatInput`

## Never

- Green / Electric Lime / `primary-500` / `#39FF14` on user bubbles (green = Green Line, not chat)
- A filled bubble on VIVA's replies
- A one-off bubble class copied into a page
- "AI" in member-facing chat copy — always "VIVA"

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="rounded-2xl bg-[#39FF14]/15 border border-[#39FF14]/20">

// GOOD
<VivaUserMessage copyText={text}>{text}</VivaUserMessage>
```
